<section class="fragment-review-dimension" data-artifact="review-dimension" data-dimension="reliability" data-rev="1">
<style>
.frd-re .frd-finding { border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 10px; overflow: hidden; }
.frd-re .frd-finding-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 9px 12px; cursor: pointer; background: #fafafa; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; }
.frd-re .frd-sev-med { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; background: #fef3e2; color: #e67e22; }
.frd-re .frd-sev-low { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; background: #e8f8f0; color: #27ae60; }
.frd-re .frd-finding-id { font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
.frd-re .frd-finding-msg { font-size: 13px; color: #555; flex: 1; }
.frd-re .frd-finding-body { padding: 10px 12px; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0; background: #fff; font-size: 13px; display: none; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; }
.frd-re .frd-finding-body.open { display: block; }
.frd-re .frd-finding-body code { background: #f4f4f4; padding: 1px 4px; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 12px; }
.frd-re .frd-fix { margin-top: 8px; padding: 8px; background: #e8f4ff; border-radius: 4px; border-left: 3px solid #2980b9; font-size: 13px; }
</style>
<div class="frd-re">

<div class="frd-finding" data-sev="med">
  <div class="frd-finding-header" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="false">
    <span class="frd-sev-med">MED</span>
    <span class="frd-finding-id">RE-1</span>
    <span class="frd-finding-msg">CancellationException not re-thrown in performFullSync outer catch</span>
  </div>
  <div class="frd-finding-body">
    <p><code>catch (e: Exception)</code> in <code>performFullSync()</code> does not re-throw <code>CancellationException</code> — violates Kotlin coroutines structured concurrency contract.</p>
    <div class="frd-fix"><strong>Fix:</strong> Add <code>if (e is CancellationException) throw e</code> as the first line of the catch block.</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="frd-finding" data-sev="low">
  <div class="frd-finding-header" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="false">
    <span class="frd-sev-low">LOW</span>
    <span class="frd-finding-id">RE-2</span>
    <span class="frd-finding-msg">reconcileNeverBackedUpArticles stops on first chunk failure</span>
  </div>
  <div class="frd-finding-body">
    <p>A transient network failure in any chunk causes the reconcile sweep to abort early. Articles in subsequent chunks are not processed until the next sync cycle (up to 15 minutes).</p>
    <div class="frd-fix"><strong>Fix:</strong> Log the failure, increment offset, continue loop rather than <code>return</code>.</div>
  </div>
</div>

</div>
<script>
(function() {
  var sec = document.currentScript.closest('.fragment-review-dimension') || document.querySelector('[data-dimension="reliability"]');
  sec.querySelectorAll('.frd-finding-header').forEach(function(h) {
    h.addEventListener('click', function() { var b = h.nextElementSibling; var o = b.classList.toggle('open'); h.setAttribute('aria-expanded', o); });
  });
  document.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('sdlc:fragment-ready', {
    detail: { name: 'review-dimension', artifact: 'review-dimension', dimension: 'reliability', rev: 1, counts: { blocker: 0, high: 0, med: 1, low: 1, nit: 0 } }
  }));
})();
</script>
</section>
